Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.41,0:00:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Gather round, come take a look...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.37,0:00:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for Theatre of Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.37,0:00:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Rain or Shine
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.18,0:00:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the story of a child who had just transferred,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.26,0:00:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,to an elementary school in a certain rural town...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Haruko-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.22,0:00:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,it's almost time for your footrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.70,0:00:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... Teacher?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.54,0:00:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.40,0:00:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't sports day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.68,0:00:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,normally be canceled in heavy rain like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.08,0:00:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,At this school,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.18,0:00:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,since long ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.50,0:00:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,the date for sports day has been set.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.94,0:00:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how bad the weather is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.50,0:00:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,it is never canceled.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.99,0:00:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.63,0:00:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless of why,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.83,0:00:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,that's just the rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.35,0:00:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone acts like it's completely normal...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.11,0:00:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it strange that I'm the only one finding this weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.72,0:00:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.22,0:00:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You came in 2nd place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.86,0:00:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The kid from the Black Team took 1st.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.18,0:00:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The Black Team?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There's the Red Team, the White Team, and the Black Team, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.54,0:01:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No, there's no such thing as a Black Team.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.18,0:01:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, the Black Team exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.20,0:01:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner of the beanbag toss is the Black Team!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.98,0:01:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner of the giant ball roll is the Black Team!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.66,0:01:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner of the relay race is also the Black Team!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.17,0:01:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth is the Black Team...?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.00,0:01:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever, who cares.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.65,0:01:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm soaking wet and covered in mud, I just want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.40,0:01:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Tug-of-war is next! Let's do our best, Haruko-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.85,0:01:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Though the Black Team is gonna win anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.11,0:01:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.07,0:01:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You must not lose to the Black Team in the tug-of-war!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.55,0:01:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you lose,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.59,0:01:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,do NOT let yourselves be pulled into the Black Team's territory!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.83,0:01:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.79,0:01:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.29,0:01:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,(Pulling hard)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.00,0:01:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.81,0:01:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no one on the Black Team,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.65,0:01:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,but we can't pull back at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.25,0:01:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,(Pulling hard)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.36,0:02:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,My feet are slipping!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.16,0:02:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,(Pulling hard)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.84,0:02:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.60,0:02:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,(Pulling hard)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.42,0:02:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Haruko-chan, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.00,0:02:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.92,0:02:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are the kids from the Black Team?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.33,0:02:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The next event is starting. Let's go together!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.56,0:02:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.84,0:02:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.53,0:02:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The next event is the Ominie-san 3-Legged Race!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.40,0:02:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomonari from Class 3-2
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.24,0:02:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You were summoned by Teacher Yuriko.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.76,0:02:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Please come in front of the stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.64,0:02:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Do your best!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.20,0:02:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Do your best!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.81,0:03:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,THE END
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.90,0:03:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Black Team(Kuro-gumi): In Japanese schools, sports days typically divide students into only the Red Team (Aka-gumi) and the White Team (Shiro-gumi). The existence of an invisible/creepy Black Team is the anomaly of this episode.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.03,0:03:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ominie-san: This is a macabre/mysterious recurring reference in the Yami Shibai universe (a ritualistic/sacrificial offering).
